        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : The constructed array BBB is [4,2,3,5,1,6][4, 2, 3, 5, 1, 6][4,2,3,5,1,6]. The inversion pairs are (1,2),(1,3),(1,5),(2,5),(3,5)(1, 2), (1, 3), (1, 5), (2, 5), (3, 5)(1,2),(1,3),(1,5),(2,5),(3,5) and (4,5)(4, 5)(4,5).\nTest Case 2 : The constructed array BBB is [4,3,3,5,3,6][4, 3, 3, 5, 3, 6][4,3,3,5,3,6]. The inversion pairs are (1,2),(1,3),(1,5)(1, 2), (1, 3), (1, 5)(1,2),(1,3),(1,5) and (4,5)(4, 5)(4,5)."
